          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrêter %@ (Option-Commande-Point)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop %@?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrêter %@ ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopped": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrêtés"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopped with exit code %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrêté avec le code de sortie %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopped with exit code %lld%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Stopped with exit code %1$lld%2$@"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrêté avec le code de sortie %1$lld%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrêter…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Storage": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stockage"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tell Me About": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Me prévenir pour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test Connection": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tester la connexion"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The **Overview** (⌘0) is the server at a glance: CPU, memory, containers, and how long it has been up.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’**Aperçu** (⌘0) montre le serveur d’un coup d’œil : processeur, mémoire, conteneurs et depuis quand il tourne."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Menu Bar Icon": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Barre des menus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Overview": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’aperçu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app stopped with an error. Its last messages say why.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’app s’est arrêtée sur une erreur. Ses derniers messages disent pourquoi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The container used more memory than it's allowed. Raise its memory limit or find what grows.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le conteneur a utilisé plus de mémoire que permis. Augmentez sa limite de mémoire ou trouvez ce qui grossit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The containers of %@ haven't logged anything yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les conteneurs de %@ n’ont encore rien écrit dans leur journal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The menu bar icon shows how the server is: a triangle when something needs a look. Its panel shows the load, what needs a look, and the containers with problems.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’icône de la barre des menus montre l’état du serveur : un triangle quand quelque chose est à vérifier. Son panneau montre la charge, ce qui est à vérifier et les conteneurs qui ont des problèmes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The merged log of %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le journal combiné de %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same alert comes at most every 15 minutes. Click a notification to see the container's log.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La même alerte arrive au plus toutes les 15 minutes. Cliquez sur une notification pour voir le journal du conteneur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The token stays in your keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le jeton reste dans votre trousseau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They stop counting as problems in the overview and in alerts, and show dimmed here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ils ne comptent plus comme problèmes dans l’aperçu et les alertes, et apparaissent estompés ici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aujourd’hui"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try Again": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réessayer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unhealthy": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En mauvaise santé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Up For": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En marche depuis"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updates": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mises à jour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updates are off in this build.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les mises à jour sont désactivées dans cette version."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Volumes": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Volumes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warnings": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avertissements"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warnings and Errors, Last %lld Hours": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avertissements et erreurs des %lld dernières heures"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warnings and errors per hour": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avertissements et erreurs par heure"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warnings and errors per hour, all containers together. Lines without a time aren't counted here. A dashed line marks Docker's restart.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avertissements et erreurs par heure, tous les conteneurs ensemble. Les lignes sans heure n’y sont pas comptées. Une ligne pointillée marque le redémarrage de Docker."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watching": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Surveillance"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What Docker is telling you": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que Docker vous dit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What’s New in Porthole": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nouveautés de Porthole"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When Docker restarts, every container logs its shutdown and startup. Those lines stay in the logs but don't count as problems or send alerts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand Docker redémarre, chaque conteneur journalise son arrêt et son démarrage. Ces lignes restent dans les journaux mais ne comptent pas comme problèmes et n’envoient pas d’alerte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a container is in trouble, a note at the top says why: a crash with its exit code, a failing health check, or a restart loop.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand un conteneur a un souci, une note en haut dit pourquoi : un plantage avec son code de sortie, un contrôle de santé qui échoue ou des redémarrages en boucle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With the icon on, Porthole keeps watching and sending alerts after you close its window. Turn it on or off in **Settings › General**.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avec l’icône, Porthole continue de surveiller et d’envoyer des alertes après la fermeture de sa fenêtre. Activez-la ou non dans **Réglages › Général**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With the menu bar icon on, Porthole keeps watching after you close its window.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avec l’icône dans la barre des menus, Porthole continue de surveiller après la fermeture de sa fenêtre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wrong disk": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mauvais disque"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "`agent/deploy.sh` installs it. It only reads, unless you start it with `PORTHOLE_ACTIONS=1`. Put it behind a login (Cloudflare Access, for example) before you open it to the internet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`agent/deploy.sh` l’installe. Il ne fait que lire, sauf si vous le lancez avec `PORTHOLE_ACTIONS=1`. Protégez-le par une connexion (Cloudflare Access, par exemple) avant de l’ouvrir sur Internet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "all %lld containers": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "les %lld conteneurs"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerd has used %lld%% CPU for 5 minutes. Stuck log readers can do this; restarting Docker clears them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "dockerd utilise %lld %% du processeur depuis 5 minutes. Des lectures de journaux bloquées peuvent en être la cause ; redémarrer Docker les libère."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "event.stopped": {
      "extractionState": "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Stopped"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrêté"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "just now": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "à l’instant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "of %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "sur %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ssh's default": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "celle de ssh par défaut"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "status.stopped": {
      "extractionState": "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Stopped"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrêté"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "user@host, or a Host from ~/.ssh/config. Porthole runs the docker command there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "utilisateur@hôte, ou un Host de ~/.ssh/config. Porthole y exécute la commande docker."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "· %lld from Docker's restart at %@ not counted": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "· %lld du redémarrage de Docker à %@ non comptés"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
